// Ch11 B01 "The drowned galleries" (C, 1 min). act2_ch11.md §2 B01. L01: the drowned arcades in a still
// turquoise lagoon under a grey noon; copper conduits along every cornice lit with steady bound teal
// (glimmer_bound: still, never flickering, never drifting: rule 3). V01: the party on the landing; Liss looks
// at the conduits the way other people look at a sunset. Pell hears the bound dead; nobody follows it up.
title: ch11_drowned_galleries
location: ch11/sunken_vey
---
@letterbox on
// Shot ids: V00 is lowlight.md's L01 (the Vey hero frame). Renamed so it can't resolve to the greybox layout's own L01
// (a sanctum view in ch11/lowlight); see act2_ch11_direction.md.
@camera V00
@music sunken_vey fade=2.0
@vfx glimmer_bound at=cornice_conduits count=12
@wait 9.0
@camera V01
Liss [smile]: Four hundred years and she's still lit. Nobody's touched her. Look at her. #line:ch11_vey_001
Pell [neutral]: Many in there. #line:ch11_vey_002 #tn:"He means the bound dead inside the lights."
@wait 1.5
@letterbox off
@camera release
===
